Z||000002||stimpy||04-13-2001||10:07 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tryxalon:<BR><B>(sniff) (sniff) <BR>Do I smell "rice" ??????? </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's messed up. I think that is a potentially hellishly powered swap. I also think it would be hellsh to hook up, but if ya got the money, more power to you. I think for the cash, though, you could put a Northstar or a turbo SBC. You are talking longitudinal mounting, yes?||||reg||1
