Z||000004||danny boy||04-13-2001||10:16 PM|||| Supras are RWD, so unless the enginge is going in the front,I dont think the 6sp is gonna work out. Maybe if it goes in longitudinally with a Porsche tranny. Interesting idea though. I couldn't imagime an engine capable of 800 streetable HP in a Fiero, though. Come to think about it, I cant imagine it in anything.<BR> I have been toying with the idea of a 6G72 out of a 3000GT/Stealth but I don't trust the FWD trannys anymore than I trust my AWD one, which is now broken.<BR>  Unless you're "huggy bear's Fiero gay, I don't think you can make a Japanese supercar rice.The lowest HP rating any of the turbo cars have is still more than 250(RX7).||||reg||1
